Arguments are:
start_date: ISO 8601 datetime for start of fetch window (e.g., "2026-03-03T06:00:00+00:00"). Defaults to 12 hours ago. Max 7 days lookback.
end_date: Optional ISO 8601 datetime for end of window. Defaults to now.
unseen: true or false — restrict to unread mail only (default false, returns all in window).
Note: only inbox mail is considered. LLM scores each message 0-10; messages below 5 are excluded.